        },
        "description": "Every error body carries a stable `code` next to the human `message`:\n\nmissing_first_name | invalid_mobile | invalid_email | invalid_api_key | ip_not_allowed | internal_error\n\nBranch on `code` in a Zapier Filter. The `message` is translated and may be reworded; the `code` will not move."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
